                                        ] .


###  https://w3id.org/at#Residential
at:Residential rdf:type owl:Class ;
               rdfs:subClassOf at:BuildingType ;
               rdfs:comment "A building designed or used predominantly for residential occupancy by one or more households. A building whose primary function is to provide dwelling or living accommodation for people." .


###  https://w3id.org/at#RoofArchetype
at:RoofArchetype rdf:type owl:Class ;
                 owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
